zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">讲述；叙述；陈述；表明；显示；证明；表现</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"159576\">この<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はなし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はアメリカに<ruby>起<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>こっていることについて<ruby>多<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くを<ruby>物語<rp>(</rp><rt>ものがた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个故事讲述了很多关于美国发生的事情。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">物差し</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ものさし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">尺子；量尺；测量棒；标准；准则；尺度；衡量标准</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">物凄い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ものすごい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">惊人的；巨大的；极端的；可怕的；恐怖的；令人毛骨悚然的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221066\">この<ruby>植物<rp>(</rp><rt>しょくぶつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>根<rp>(</rp><rt>ね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>水<rp>(</rp><rt>みず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がものすごく<ruby>必要<rp>(</rp><rt>ひつよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这种植物的根需要大量的水。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">モノレール</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">单轨铁路；单轨电车</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">揉む</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">揉；揉皱；按摩；推拿；争论；激烈争论；训练；指导；推挤；拥挤；摇晃；晃动；经历；获得各种阅历</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"211126\">その<ruby>結果<rp>(</rp><rt>けっか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>報道<rp>(</rp><rt>ほうどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>満足<rp>(</rp><rt>まんぞく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>手<rp>(</rp><rt>て</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をもんでうれしがっていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他对这份报纸的结果感到高兴。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">燃やす</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もやす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">燃烧；点燃；燃烧；激昂</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223877\">このガラクタは<ruby>火<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>燃<rp>(</rp><rt>も</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>やしなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">把这个火焰烧在火中。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">催し</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もよおし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">活动；庆典；聚会；举办；召开</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">盛る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">盛（饭菜等）；装盘；舀；盛满（碗）；堆积；堆叠；堆满；装满；给药；（按剂量）投药；开药；下毒；加入；记入；写进；表达；标记；刻度；标注刻度；夸大；浮夸；浓妆；涂厚</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">問答</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もんどう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">问答；对话</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">モーター</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">马达；电动机</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"212638\">そのボートは<ruby>動力<rp>(</rp><rt>どうりょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にモーターを<ruby>使用<rp>(</rp><rt>しよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>している。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">船只使用动力发动机。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">やかましい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">喧闹的；吵闹的；嘈杂的；议论纷纷的；众说纷纭的；引起争议的；严格的；严厉的；苛刻的；挑剔的；讲究的；吹毛求疵的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"112791\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>事<rp>(</rp><rt>こと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはあまりやかましくない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他对这件事不太无情。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">夜間</s